   "about": "A promise by the US Treasury to pay 100 dollars on 1 January 2035. It pays nothing before that, so it costs less than 100 today and the difference is your interest. If interest rates rise in the meantime the price falls, and if they fall it rises; the further away 2035 is, the stronger the effect. Held until 2035, it pays exactly what was promised."
